OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 DEC
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker marks the 90th
OL,6,     Gbirthday of the BBC Scottish
OL,7,     GSymphony Orchestra, she also has
OL,8,     Gexclusive recordings of great
OL,9,     GRomantic violin concertos and
OL,10,     Gchamber music from Sweden.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,13,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,14,     Gmusical life in his 80th birthday
OL,15,     Gyear. Today, they discuss new
OL,16,     Gcreative ventures and the
OL,17,     Gsanctuary of home.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GKatie welcomes Barbara Hannigan
OL,20,     GDarius Brubeck and Dave O'Higgins
OL,21,     Gto In Tune.
