OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 5 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,8,     GOpera goes to the movies, and
OL,9,     Gmovie music comes to life, as the
OL,10,     GBBC Concert Orchestra and a
OL,11,     Gglittering array of soloists
OL,12,     Gsalute the genius of Puccini.
OL,13,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,14,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,15,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,16,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,17,     GTonight, Laurie Anderson, who
OL,18,     Gbrought the avant-garde into the
OL,19,     Gmainstream in the 1980s.
